<text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
  <body>
    <div rend="parallel"> 
      <p xml:id="Aink199-kilavi">
       talaimakaṉ oruvaḻit taṇantuḻi āṟṟāḷākiya talaimakaḷai āṟṟuvikkuntōḻi colliyatu.</p>    <p xml:lang="en">
       Spoken by the confidante who comforts the heroine who could not bear [the separation], when the hero went his own way.</p>
  </div> 
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="Aink199">
<l>kāṉalam peruntuṟaik kalitirai tiḷaikkum</l>
<l>vāṉuyar neṭumaṇa lēṟiyā ṉātu</l>
<l>kāṇkam vammō tōḻi</l>
<l>ceṟivaḷai nekiḻttō ṉeṟikaṭa ṉāṭē</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:lang="en">
        <l>Having climbed the tall sands that are sky-high</l>
        <l>Where the bustling waves at the great ghat with the seashore grove bubble,</l>
        <l>Come, oh friend! We can see</l>
        <l>The land with vast seas of the man who made slip [your] close-set bangles.</l>      </lg>
    </div>
  </body>
</text>
